WARNING:DEVICE_ATTR_FUNCTIONS: Consider renaming function(s) '_ctl_BRM_status_show' to 'BRM_status_show'
#194: FILE: drivers/scsi/mpt3sas/mpt3sas_ctl.c:2790:
